		(descr "Epson FA-128 32 MHz crystal, 2.0 x 1.6 x 0.5 mm, 4-pad. Land pattern is Epson's own recommendation: 0.50 x 0.85 mm pads on 0.95 mm (X) by 1.15 mm (Y) centres, giving a 1.45 x 2.00 mm outer envelope. KiCad's generic Crystal_SMD_2016-4Pin_2.0x1.6mm does NOT match - it uses 0.90 x 0.80 mm pads on 1.40 x 1.10 mm centres, a 2.30 mm outer span in X, which is 0.85 mm wider than Epson specify. Pads 1 and 3 are the crystal terminals; pads 2 and 4 are the metal cover and must go to ground.")
